        <!-- command.yml -->
        <mxCell id="m-command" value="&lt;b&gt;command.yml&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;17 tasks | 9 asserts | 1 bad data&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• single command (enable)&lt;br&gt;• multi-command list&lt;br&gt;• cli / enable / config levels&lt;br&gt;• fallback to show system-info&lt;br&gt;• commands overrides command&lt;br&gt;• check_mode no-op&lt;br&gt;• return structure validation&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b91c1c&quot;&gt;✗ invalid command_level&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8f8f8;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=9;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="200" y="510" width="170" height="175" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- system.yml -->
        <mxCell id="m-system" value="&lt;b&gt;system.yml&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;39 tasks | 19 asserts | 6 bad data&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• hostname / location / contact&lt;br&gt;• idempotency (read-before-write)&lt;br&gt;• DNS primary + secondary&lt;br&gt;• LLDP enable + disable + restore&lt;br&gt;• NTP 2 servers (min)&lt;br&gt;• NTP 5 servers (max)&lt;br&gt;• all params combined&lt;br&gt;• check_mode&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b91c1c&quot;&gt;✗ secondary without primary&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b91c1c&quot;&gt;✗ NTP wrong type / missing fields&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8f8f8;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=9;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="380" y="510" width="170" height="175" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- vlans.yml -->
        <mxCell id="m-vlans" value="&lt;b&gt;vlans.yml&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;22 tasks | 11 asserts | 5 bad data&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• named VLANs (910–930)&lt;br&gt;• static IP SVI&lt;br&gt;• DHCP SVI&lt;br&gt;• boundary: vlan_id 1&lt;br&gt;• boundary: vlan_id 4094&lt;br&gt;• check_mode&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b91c1c&quot;&gt;✗ vlan_id 0 and 4095&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b91c1c&quot;&gt;✗ ip+dhcp mutual exclusion&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b91c1c&quot;&gt;✗ ip without mask&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8f8f8;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=9;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="560" y="510" width="170" height="175" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- interfaces.yml -->
        <mxCell id="m-interfaces" value="&lt;b&gt;interfaces.yml&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;37 tasks | 18 asserts | 4 bad data&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• all 4 port_types&lt;br&gt;• speed: 10/100/1000/2500/10000/auto&lt;br&gt;• enabled true/false&lt;br&gt;• PVID + untagged/tagged/disabled VLANs&lt;br&gt;• acceptable_frame_type: tagged / all&lt;br&gt;• description (spaces + plain)&lt;br&gt;• fully-qualified interface name&lt;br&gt;• multiple interfaces per call&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b91c1c&quot;&gt;✗ unknown port_type / speed / frame_type&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8f8f8;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=9;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
