        </mxCell>

        <!-- user.yml -->
        <mxCell id="m-user" value="&lt;b&gt;user.yml&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;40 tasks | 20 asserts | 6 bad data&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• all 5 privilege levels&lt;br&gt;• encryption_type 0 / 5 / 7&lt;br&gt;• update_password: on_create vs always&lt;br&gt;• bulk users list&lt;br&gt;• name + users together&lt;br&gt;• save_config: true&lt;br&gt;• password redaction assertion&lt;br&gt;• state: absent (idempotent)&lt;br&gt;• teardown block&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b91c1c&quot;&gt;✗ username &gt;16 chars / with spaces&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b91c1c&quot;&gt;✗ create without password&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8f8f8;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=9;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
